= Heinrich Brandler

A building worker and trade unionist from Chemnitz, where the party is strong because it never left the unions. Stocky, practical and blunt. [? if c_lead = 3 : He leads the Zentrale now. ?]

- @branches
- @workers_government
- @root: Return to main

@branches
title: Work the Union Branches
subtitle: [? if lock_union_work = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Communists win posts in the unions. Saxony is proud of its own.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?][? if lock_union_work = 2 : The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids work inside the old unions. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and lock_union_work < 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
if (Q.lock_union_work == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 5;
Q.district_saxony_loyalty += 6;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 5;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

Brandler sends the Chemnitz method to every district: be the best trade unionists in the branch, and the branch will follow.

@workers_government
title: Propose a Workers' Government
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Offer the social democrats a government of the workers' parties. The Left is appalled.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?][? if lock_united_front = 2 : The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any deal with the social democrats. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and lock_united_front < 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 5;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.spd_relation += 6;
Q.uspd_relation += 4;
Q.worker_support += 2;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 6;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 4;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

If the social democrats mean what they say about socialism, Brandler says, let them govern with us and arm the workers. If they refuse, their own members will ask why.
